# sofascore-env — local dev environment

Runs everything that *can* run locally — `composer`, `phpstan`, `php-cs-fixer`,
the test suite, `bin/console` — inside a throwaway container, so the host stays
clean (no PHP installed). The browser-facing app runs on the remote dev server.

This folder lives **outside** the project repo and is never committed to it.
Nothing here modifies any tracked project file. The folder is managed by
**chezmoi** (dotfiles repo, source: `~/.local/share/chezmoi/Projects/localdev/sofascore-env/`,
Linux-only via `.chezmoiignore`), so a new machine gets it from `chezmoi apply`.
Edit the chezmoi source (`chezmoi edit <file>`), not the deployed copy.

---

## Architecture — where things run

| Layer | What | Name / location |
|---|---|---|
| **Host (clean)** | nvim/tmux, VS Code, git, Docker, NetBird, node/npm + intelephense | your machine — no PHP |
| **Tools container** | PHP (version pinned from the repo's `Dockerfile`) + Composer + phpstan/cs-fixer/paratest | `sofascore_tools` (this `compose.dev.yaml`) |
| **Test services** | postgres · redis · elasticsearch · beanstalk | 4 containers from the repo's `compose.test-local.yaml` |
| **Dev server** | the running web app | `ssh dev` → `{{ dig "sofascore" "devWorkspace" "SET-data.sofascore.devWorkspace-IN-chezmoi.toml" . }}` → {{ dig "sofascore" "appUrl" "SET-data.sofascore.appUrl-IN-chezmoi.toml" . }} |

## What's in this folder

| File | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `compose.dev.yaml` | The `tools` container: PHP + Composer. Host networking + same-path bind mount, runs as your UID. Mounts the repo's `docker/base/php/99-sofa.ini`. |
| `php.ini` | Local overrides on top of `99-sofa.ini` (mounted as `zz-local.ini`; empty by default = parity with the project). |
| `doctor.sh` | Setup health check (`make doctor`). |
| `.env` | `SOFASCORE_REPO` — rendered by chezmoi from `dot_env.tmpl` (per-OS path). |
| `vscode/` | VS Code templates (settings / sftp / launch) — `make vscode` renders them into the repo's gitignored `.vscode/`. |
| `Makefile` | `up`, `down`, `shell`, `install`, `phpstan`, `cs`, `test`, `test-up`, `test-down`, `vscode`, `doctor` (`make help`). Reads `PHP_VERSION` / `PHP_EXTENSION_INSTALLER_VERSION` from the repo's `Dockerfile`. |
| `bin/` | PATH shims: `php`, `composer`, `phpstan`, `php-cs-fixer`, `paratest`, `console`. They auto-start the container if it's down, and resolve `vendor/bin/*` against the repo root (work from any subdir). |

