## One-time setup (new machine)

```sh
# 0. Host prereqs: Docker (service enabled), NetBird, VS Code, your shell. NO PHP needed.
# 1. Clone the project to the path in dot_env.tmpl, then `chezmoi apply`:
#    deploys this folder AND puts bin/ on PATH (dot_zshrc.tmpl).
# 2. Build + start the tools container and install deps:
cd ~/Projects/localdev/sofascore-env
make up
make install            # composer install -> writes the gitignored vendor/
make vscode             # .vscode/{settings,sftp,launch}.json for this machine
make doctor             # verify everything
```

Open a **new** shell afterwards so the shims are on `PATH`.

